# 360Ghar Editorial — 360ghar_editorial.ds

> A sophisticated architectural editorial system for premium real estate. Prioritizes professional clarity, whitespace, and high-contrast typography.

## Instructions
- Use `Playfair Display` for all major headings and display text.
- Maintain a strict asymmetrical grid with generous whitespace.
- Use 1px rules in brand orange (`{color.palette.accent}`) as structural dividers.
- Avoid heavy cards; use depth and rules to separate content blocks.

## Brand & Accent
- Orange (`{color.palette.accent}`): Precise architectural accent — 1px rules, index markers, small icons.

## Surface
- Clean white (`{color.palette.canvas}`) for everything. Surface-soft for subtle section shifts.

## Typography
- Editorial Serif (`Playfair Display`) for headings. Modern Sans (`Manrope`) for UI and body. Monospace for indexing/meta data.

## Layout
- 50/50 vertical split for hero sections. Asymmetrical masonry for property galleries.

## Signature
- Asymmetrical "Split Editorial" hero with edge-to-edge high-quality photography.
- Numbered "Index Grid" for value propositions.
- Large serif pull-quotes for testimonials.